      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\frac{5x^2+10x}{(x+1)^2}\\qquad x\\neq -1\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{\\mathrm dy}{\\mathrm dx}=\\dfrac{A}{(x+1)^n}\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\"></span> are constants to be found. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li><li>Hence deduce the range of values for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span> for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{\\mathrm dy}{\\mathrm dx}&lt;0\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li></ol>",
