      "question": "<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)=2x^2+4x+9\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(x)\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a(x+b)^2+c\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\"></span> are integers to be found. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Sketch the curve with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\mathrm f(x)\"></span> showing any points of intersection with the coordinate axes and the coordinates of any turning point. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>Describe fully the transformation that maps the curve with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\mathrm f(x)\"></span> onto the curve with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\mathrm g(x)\"></span> where<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm g(x)=2(x-2)^2+4x-3\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R\" data-display=\"true\"></div></li><li>Find the range of the function<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathrm h(x)=\\frac{21}{2x^2+4x+9}\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol></li></ol>",
